EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Yar! Are ye {{TAG:0003:0000:}}in such a great hurry?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Didn't ye just start this voyage?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Ye should just be listenin' to
me song!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}¡Ar! ¿Tanta prisa tienes?{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¡Pero si acabamos de zarpar!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Con la canción tan hermosa
que tenía preparada...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Kôa ! Y a {{TAG:0003:0006:}}pas l'feu au lac ! Ni à la
mer d'ailleurs... Kôa !{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Dire que j'avais une p'tite chanson
pour toi...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Per tutti i marosi! {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Hai così
tanta fretta?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ma non siamo appena partiti?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Quando qualcuno canta, è buona
educazione ascoltare fino alla fine!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Garrr, was soll die Eile?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Wir sind doch gerade eben erst
losgeschippert!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0023:}} Willste etwa kein
nettes Schiefferlied hörn?{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Don't be goin' and rushin' things!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
The island, she ain't goin' nowhere.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0003:0005:}}All right then, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}off we be to sea!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}¿A qué viene esa impaciencia?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
¡Si la isla no se va a mover del sitio!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}¡Hay que disfrutar de la travesía!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Was haste es denn so eilig?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Die Insel
wird nich' einfach davonschwimmen,
wir haben also Zeit,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} jaharrr!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}What be this? Ye seasick?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Well then,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
think o' me song as a lullaby to help
soothe yer sloppy belly.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Qué te pasa? ¿Te has mareado?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Pues escucha mis nanas.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} ¡Calman
los estómagos revueltos!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Tu nous fais quoi, là ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}T'as l'mal de
mer ?{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} J'espère qu'c'est pas ma
chanson qui t'chamboule l'estomac !{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Was soll die Ungeduld, Landratte?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Setzt dir der hohe Wellengang
etwa zu?
{{TAG:0003:0028:}}Arrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} da sing ich dir 'ne beruhigende
Seemannsweise, und du beschwerst
dich noch!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ne oldu? Denizi mi tuttu?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}Öyleyse,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
şarkımı midenin dalgasını
bastıran bir ninni say.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Yar and yo ho!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Since ye made it this
far,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}it only be customary that ye
shush an' a-listen till the very end!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}¡Por los bigotes del kraken!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ya que
he empezado,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} por lo menos podías
dejarme acabar la canción, ¿no?{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Kôôaa !{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} T'as l'air de t'ennuyer, mon
p'tit bulot.{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Rien d'tel qu'une p'tite
chanson pour tuer l'temps !{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Jetzt nimm mal etwas Wind
aus den Segeln, klarrr?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Zu 'ner guten Überfahrt gehört
nun mal ein gutes Schifferlied!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Yarr, heyamola!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} Buraya kadar
geldiğine göre,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}usulünce susup
şarkının sonunu dinlemek düşer!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Vaya con la anguila acelerada...{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
Me has interrumpido cuando
venía la mejor parte, ¡ar!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}C'est bien dommage,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} moussaillon !{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}
J'allais entonner l'couplet sur les
homards qu'ont l'cafard...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Was biste denn so zappelig, du
kleine Nesselqualle?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Dabei hab ich
extra mit Meerwasser gegurgelt!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

{{TAG:0003:001D:}}Harrr, bald ist schon wieder
eine Überfahrt vorbei!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Überall zufriedene Kunden!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Why ye be interruptin' me singin'?!
Just when I be a-croonin' like me
dear ol' mum taught me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}¿Me interrumpes en pleno recital?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Los jóvenes deberíais aprender
estas canciones, ¡o se perderán!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}De quel droit tu m'interromps au
beau milieu d'ma chanson ?! J'allais
sortir ma note favorite !{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Garrr, was unterbrichste mich
denn?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} So 'ne Überfahrt ohne
Lied ist doch nur halb so schön!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Şarkımın ortasında niye sözümü
kesiyorsun?! Tam da rahmetli
anamın öğrettiği gibi söylüyordum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Kôa ! {{TAG:0003:0000:}}T'as tellement hâte d'arriver ?
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Tu pourrais au moins écouter ma
chanson jusqu'au bout...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Cooosa? {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Vuoi tornare in città?
Ti si sono attorcigliati i tentacoli
intorno al cervello?!?!
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Avresti dovuto fare {{TAG:000E:0006:100069006C00200062007200610076006F0010006C006100200062007200610076006100}}
e ascoltare la mia canzone
fino alla fine!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Yar har har! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Ye gettin' homesick?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Well, ye be needin' to grow a tough
shell an' get on wit' yer life.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}¡Jar, jar, jar! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}¿Echas de menos tu
casita?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:002B:}}¡Deberías hacer como yo
y llevar una a cuestas!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Kôôa ! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}T'as hâte de rentrer ?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}
Du calme, p'tite crevette,
elle va pas s'envoler, ta maison...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Per tutti i moli del mondo! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Cosa
ti prende?{{TAG:0007:0000:0F000000}} Ti manca casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0001:}}Ricorda:
le canzoni si ascoltano fino alla fine.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Jaharrr! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Kriegste schon Heimweh?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Da musste dir 'ne harte Schale
wachsen lassen und schon wird
alles besser, jarrr...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Yar har har! {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}Evini mi özledin?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:002B:}}Biraz kabuğunu kalınlaştır da
hayata devam et, denizci.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Garrr!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Was wirfste denn dauernd
deinen Anker?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Ist doch alles halb
so schlimm, {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Der alte Käpten passt schon auf,
dass wir nich' auf Grund laufen!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Yarr!{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} Çapa atıp durma, yaygara
koparma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0011:0000:0000}}!{{TAG:0003:0000:}}{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Benim teknemdesin;
tuzlu çenemden
dökülenleri keyifle dinlemen
gerekir!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0002:}}Yar har har!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}If ye need to use th' bathroom, yer
outta luck! Ye should just hold yer
horses {{TAG:0003:0023:}}an' listen to me love song.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}¡Podrías haber ido al baño antes de
zarpar!{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} O por lo menos aguantarte
un rato y escuchar mi balada{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Une envie pressante, mon p'tit
bigorneau ? {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Navré, mais va falloir
te retenir...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Hai bisogno di andare in bagno?
{{TAG:0003:0023:}}Mi dispiace, ma dovrai avere
ancora un po' di pazienza...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tuvaletin geldiyse şansına küs!
Biraz dişini sık {{TAG:0003:0023:}}da aşk şarkımı
dinle.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}¡Gracias por escuchar mi canción
por tan brevísimos instantes!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Total,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0003:0007:}}¡me encanta que me
interrumpan cuando canto!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Merci d'avoir écouté ma chanson,
hein...{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Quelle journée... Mais quelle
journée...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Grazie per aver ascoltato
la mia canzone!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Che giornata memorabile! {{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Resterà
nella storia della navigazione!{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

ES:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}¿Sabes lo que te digo,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} timonel de
agua dulce?{{TAG:0007:0000:19000000}} {{TAG:0003:0023:}}Que ya que estás aquí,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
bien podrías aguantar un canturreo.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Beh, {{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}visto che ormai siamo qui{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.
Potresti almeno ascoltare una delle
mie vecchie canzoni da marinaio...{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Jarrr,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} wo du schon mal auf meinem
Kutter bist, kannste dir auch 'n
paar Seemannsweisen anhören{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Ist doch gar nich' mehr weit...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bevor
du zappelst wie 'n Landkrebs, lass
dich doch einfach treiben, jarrr?{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Gar? Ye be a scallywag!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Even as I be
goin' out of me way and feelin' all
good a-singin' fer ya{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}ye be pushin' the button or what
have ye! All clicky clicky click{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Be ye in that much of a rush?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Well,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} if that be th' deal...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}I'll quit me singin' an' just
get us to the destination.

FR:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Kôa ?! Nom d'un banc de goujons !{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}
Dire que j'ai écrit cette chanson
juste pour toi{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Et toi tu n'penses qu'à décamper !
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}À moins qu't'aies appuyé là où y
faut pas par mégarde{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Mais bon, tant pis pour toi.{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0000:}}Je vais
fermer mon clapet si c'est comme
ça...

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Per tutti i catamarani!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Io mi sto
sgolando per farti passare il tempo
della traversata più in fretta{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}... e tu che fai? Ce la metti tutta
per cercare di farmi smettere!
{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Ma che ti prende?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Beh,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} se proprio ci tieni...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}la smetto di cantare e
ti porto subito a destinazione.{{TAG:0007:000D:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000F:}}Yarr? Seni haylaz denizci!{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} {{TAG:0003:0009:}}Ben burada
senin için içimden gelerek
şarkı söylüyorum{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}sen durmadan düğmeye basıyorsun!
Tık tık tık tık{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Bu kadar mı acelen var?
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Peki,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} madem öyle...{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0000:}}şarkıyı kesip bizi doğruca
varacağımız yere götüreyim.
